# Weather Channel structure watchdog - runs once every 24 hours.
#
# Install (Linux/macOS):
#   crontab -e
#   then append the line below (adjust the path to this project).
#
# Log rotation is handled by the watchdog itself: at most 10 HTML snapshots
# are kept under logs/snapshots/.

# minute hour day month weekday   command
0 6 * * *   cd /opt/weather-channel-desktop && /usr/bin/python3 tools/daily_structure_check.py --location USNY0996 >> logs/cron.log 2>&1
